aceful degradation: model versions without a producing-run reference show\n54\t  no lineage link and no errors.\n55\t\n56\t## Acceptance Criteria\n57\t\n58\t- Given a registered model version that carries a producing-run reference,\n59\t  the Model Registry UI in the Dashboard displays the run that produced it.\n60\t- Given such a model version, when the user opens the comparison from the\n61\t  registry, then the comparison view opens seeded with the producing run and\n62\t  the user can select additional runs to compare against.\n63\t- Given a model version with no producing-run reference, the registry page\n64\t  renders without a lineage link and without errors.\n65\t\n66\t## HLR Traceability\n67\t\n68\t- HLR-2 (P1, UI side): a comparison can be opened from the Model Registry.\n69\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ae2e8ec433ea9756","agent_id":"ae23a91974ef9b39d","session_id":"a66a1624-e5ea-4bd7-921c-fe9a2fc3883b","uuid":"f581e531-fea9-4bc3-90e3-cec909305387","timestamp":"2026-10-21T17:04:22.286Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9b39ced2ecfdeac5","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9015 decomposition"}
