{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-910ec61b11484c8d","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9015-E003\n3\ttitle: Open run comparison from the Model Registry in the Dashboard\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9015\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-9015-E001\n11\t- RHAISTRAT-9015-E002\n12\tai_signals:\n13\t  change_specificity: 0\n14\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n15\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n16\t  existing_foundation: 1\n17\t  open_questions: 1\n18\t  external_dependency: 1\n19\t  human_process_gates: 1\n20\t  repo_access: 1\n21\t  architecture_claims: 0\n22\timplementation_type: null\n23\tinvestigation_signals: null\n24\tai_implementability: High\n25\tai_implementability_score: 6\n26\tjira_key: null\n27\tbranch: null\n28\tgated_by: null\n29\tgate_failure_impact: null\n30\t---\n31\t# Open run comparison from the Model Registry in the Dashboard\n32\t\n33\t## Description\n34\t\n35\tThis epic surfaces run lineage in the Dashboard's Model Registry UI: a\n36\tregistered model version shows the run that produced it, and the user can open\n37\tthe run comparison view from there, seeded with that run. This connects model\n38\tpromotion decisions to the underlying experiments without leaving the\n39\tplatform.\n40\t\n41\tThis work depends on two capabilities being in place: the run comparison view\n42\tin the Dashboard (so there is a comparison to open and seed), and the\n43\tproducing-run reference stored on registered model versions by the Model\n44\tRegistry (so there is lineage to display).\n45\t\n46\t## Scope\n47\t\n48\t- Display the producing-run reference on registered model versions in the\n49\t  Dashboard's Model Registry UI.\n50\t- Provide an action from a model version to open the run comparison view\n51\t  seeded with its producing run, allowing the user to add further runs for\n52\t  side-by-side comparison.\n53\t- Graceful degradation: model versions without a producing-run reference show\n54\t  no lineage link and no errors.\n55\t\n56\t## Acceptance Criteria\n57\t\n58\t- Given a registered model version that carries a producing-run reference,\n59\t  the Model Registry UI in the Dashboard displays the run that produced it.\n60\t- Given such a model version, when the user opens the comparison from the\n61\t  registry, then the comparison view opens seeded with the producing run and\n62\t  the user can select additional runs to compare against.\n63\t- Given a model version with no producing-run reference, the registry page\n64\t  renders without a lineage link and without errors.\n65\t\n66\t## HLR Traceability\n67\t\n68\t- HLR-2 (P1, UI side): a comparison can be opened from the Model Registry.\n69\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ab5e0f38c6e8aeee","agent_id":"aaaa44161d60520c4","session_id":"a66a1624-e5ea-4bd7-921c-fe9a2fc3883b","uuid":"0bdc5aee-ffa3-4370-b0f7-419729a4bdd8","timestamp":"2026-10-21T17:17:24.328Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-910ec61b11484c8d","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Second revision of RHAISTRAT-9015"}
