\n- Reuse of the run comparison surface's multi-select and parameter/metric\n  retrieval; no duplicate comparison surface or second data path is built\n  (coordination gate with the side-by-side comparison work).\n- Unchanged values are distinguishable from changed ones.\n- Diff comparison stays within a single project, consistent with the\n  side-by-side view's scoping.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- Given two selected runs, when the user opens the diff view, then parameters\n  and metrics that changed between the two runs are highlighted, and unchanged\n  values are distinguishable from changed ones.\n- The diff view is rendered within the same comparison surface as the\n  side-by-side view, reusing its run selection and parameter/metric retrieval;\n  no second comparison surface or data path is introduced.\n- The diff view operates on runs within a single project only, consistent with\n  the side-by-side comparison scoping.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-3 (P1): provide a run \"diff\" view that highlights which parameters and\n  metrics changed between two selected runs.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":26713,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ab5e0f38c6e8aeee","agent_id":"aaaa44161d60520c4","session_id":"a66a1624-e5ea-4bd7-921c-fe9a2fc3883b","uuid":"3aea09a2-b1b8-432e-920d-061341f95d7f","timestamp":"2026-10-21T17:19:52.943Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Second revision of RHAISTRAT-9015"}
