{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9c423108dc5a2157","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9015-E005\n3\ttitle: Run diff view in the Dashboard\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9015\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tai_signals:\n10\t  change_specificity: 0\n11\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n12\t  adapter_pattern: 1\n13\t  existing_foundation: 1\n14\t  open_questions: 1\n15\t  external_dependency: 1\n16\t  human_process_gates: 1\n17\t  repo_access: 1\n18\t  architecture_claims: 0\n19\timplementation_type: null\n20\tdependencies:\n21\t- RHAISTRAT-9015-E001\n22\tinvestigation_signals: null\n23\tai_implementability: High\n24\tai_implementability_score: 7\n25\tjira_key: null\n26\tbranch: null\n27\tgated_by: null\n28\tgate_failure_impact: null\n29\t---\n30\t# Run diff view in the Dashboard\n31\t\n32\t## Description\n33\t\n34\tThis epic delivers the run \"diff\" view: when a user has selected two runs to\n35\tcompare, the view highlights which parameters and metrics changed between\n36\tthem, so data scientists can immediately see what differed between candidate\n37\truns when making model promotion decisions. It is a deferrable enhancement to\n38\tthe side-by-side run comparison capability: the side-by-side view is fully\n39\tusable without it.\n40\t\n41\tThis work depends on the side-by-side run comparison capability being in\n42\tplace: the diff view is rendered within that comparison surface and reuses its\n43\trun selection and parameter/metric retrieval rather than building a second\n44\tsurface. The shared surface is handled as a coordination gate on this epic,\n45\tnot as a reason to fuse the two features into one priority.\n46\t\n47\t## Scope\n48\t\n49\t- Diff view that highlights which parameters and metrics differ between two\n50\t  selected runs, rendered within the existing run comparison surface.\n51\t- Reuse of the run comparison surface's multi-select and parameter/metric\n52\t  retrieval; no duplicate comparison surface or second data path is built\n53\t  (coordination gate with the side-by-side comparison work).\n54\t- Unchanged values are distinguishable from changed ones.\n55\t- Diff comparison stays within a single project, consistent with the\n56\t  side-by-side view's scoping.\n57\t\n58\t## Acceptance Criteria\n59\t\n60\t- Given two selected runs, when the user opens the diff view, then parameters\n61\t  and metrics that changed between the two runs are highlighted, and unchanged\n62\t  values are distinguishable from changed ones.\n63\t- The diff view is rendered within the same comparison surface as the\n64\t  side-by-side view, reusing its run selection and parameter/metric retrieval;\n65\t  no second comparison surface or data path is introduced.\n66\t- The diff view operates on runs within a single project only, consistent with\n67\t  the side-by-side comparison scoping.\n68\t\n69\t## HLR Traceability\n70\t\n71\t- HLR-3 (P1): provide a run \"diff\" view that highlights which parameters and\n72\t  metrics changed between two selected runs.\n73\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b69241d1f68fb7e1","agent_id":"a4882fb7b245e47bb","session_id":"a66a1624-e5ea-4bd7-921c-fe9a2fc3883b","uuid":"460cd4bd-2e6a-43aa-b62a-616b5608fa8b","timestamp":"2026-10-21T17:21:46.547Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9c423108dc5a2157","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review after second revision"}
